===========================

WORKSPACE STRUCTURE
-------------------
This workspace contains documentation and notes organized across 4 directories:
- input/    : Core specification and metadata
- docs/     : User guide (contains redundant info)
- notes/    : Task tracking and duplicate notes
- output/   : Generated output directory

MOST IMPORTANT FILES (High Signal)
----------------------------------
1. input/README.md    - Workspace overview and entry point
